WEBVTT

NOTE
Fixture for the `thumbnail` part (SeekSlider's `thumbnails` prop). Cues
divide tracer-10s.mp4's 10 seconds into five equal 2s spans, one per tile of
thumbnails-sprite.svg's horizontal strip, left to right in time order:

  0:00-0:02 -> tile 0, x=0   (red)
  0:02-0:04 -> tile 1, x=160 (green)
  0:04-0:06 -> tile 2, x=320 (blue)
  0:06-0:08 -> tile 3, x=480 (yellow)
  0:08-0:10 -> tile 4, x=640 (magenta)

Changing the sprite's tile count, size or order without updating the five
timestamps and #xywh= fragments below breaks this mapping. The image URL is
root-absolute rather than routed through stories/asset-url.ts: this file is
static text with no template mechanism, and root-absolute is exactly what
that resolver produces at the `/` base path every automated command in
apps/storybook/README.md runs at.

